    "long_instructions": "## **Predict & Run**\r\n\r\nLook at the code in the workspace. Each variable stores a value with a data type: a string, an int, or the text you type in for input(). If a user types \"Math\" when asked for their favorite subject, what will the program print?\r\n\r\nWrite your prediction.\r\n\r\nPress Run to check your answer.",
